","video_desc":"当红女星忆云为探寻挚友江乔惨死的真相，与贺家家主贺钰假意结婚，最终揭露以傅晏城和黎眠为主导的“人鱼画”桃色陷阱，并最终为江乔复仇。真相大白后，幕后黑手傅晏城伏法，忆云以京城林家千金的身份亲手终结了这场豪门权谋与娱乐圈的腥风血雨。","series_id":"7507560009467694142","episode":true,"vertical":true,"content_type":1,"recommend_info":"{\"channel_id\":\"94349560332\",\"request_id\":\"202611062356477925EF89270260AC608B\",\"rank\":\"9\",\"queue_names\":\"shortplay\",\"final_queue_name\":\"heji\",\"gid\":\"7507560009467694142\",\"plan_id\":\"1\",\"is_show_ad_flag\":\"0\",\"series_pred_score\":\"{\\\"absolute_staytime\\\":0.10215643793344498,\\\"stream_ctr\\\":0.04963405430316925,\\\"like\\\":0.04885777458548546,\\\"staytime_stream\\\":1.016249656677246,\\\"finish\\\":0.020964238792657852,\\\"collect\\\":0.033589500933885574,\\\"normalized_duration\\\":0.6792821288108826}\"}","recommend_group_id":"7507560009467694142","play_cnt":54552,"book_exist":false,"copyright":"干将未来","sub_title":"悬疑·悬疑推理","score":"8.1","use_video_model":true,"episode_cnt":45,"video_platform":3,"disable_play":false,"category_schema":"[{\"category_id\":5004,\"name\":\"悬疑\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5004&categoryName=悬疑&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5055,\"name\":\"悬疑推理\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5055&categoryName=悬疑推理&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5254,\"name\":\"揭露阴谋\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5254&categoryName=揭露阴谋&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5332,\"name\":\"强强联合\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5332&categoryName=强强联合&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5206,\"name\":\"总裁\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5206&categoryName=总裁&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5338,\"name\":\"现代\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5338&categoryName=现代&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5320,\"name\":\"娱乐圈\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://cate